=== PARITY (vs web SleepEfficiencyWidget.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared state-holder seam (SleepEfficiencySource -> SleepEfficiencyModel):
    useVehicles, useEnergy, useSleepEfficiency, useTranslation. The production app wires
